#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/DeploymentSettings.php:94
msgid "Deployment Management"
msgstr "Deploymentbeheer"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/DeploymentSettings.php:104
msgid "Here you can manage the deployment scope of modules and features. It gives allowance to be launched in the corresponding or lower environments (development, staging, production). Although you can set a feature to a higher deployment than the module it is part of, the feature will not be launched beyond the deployment scope of the parent module. Only if both module and feature are set to production deployment, the feature will be launched in a production environment."
msgstr "Hier beheer je het deploymentniveau van modules en features. Het bepaalt in welke omgeving ze mogen starten: de bijbehorende of een lagere (development, staging, productie). Je kunt een feature een hoger niveau geven dan zijn module, maar de feature start nooit buiten het niveau van de module. Alleen als module en feature allebei op productie staan, start de feature in een productieomgeving."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/DeploymentSettings.php:359
msgid "Critical Error: Failed to save the deployment states."
msgstr "Kritieke fout: de deploymentniveaus konden niet worden opgeslagen."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/DeploymentSettings.php:363
msgid "Release status settings saved successfully. Remember to commit changes in Git! 🚀"
msgstr "Deploymentniveaus opgeslagen. Vergeet niet de wijzigingen in Git te committen! 🚀"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:78
msgid "Feature Activation"
msgstr "Features activeren"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:88
msgid "Here you can enable and disable the modules and features in this plugin. Refreshing this list, will perform a scan that automatically detect new modules and features if there are any. By default new modules and features will be disabled en need to be enabled to launch them."
msgstr "Hier zet je de modules en features van deze plugin aan en uit. Vernieuwen voert een scan uit die nieuwe modules en features vindt. Nieuwe modules en features staan standaard uit en moeten eerst worden aangezet."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:164
msgid "Select all"
msgstr "Alles selecteren"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:165
msgid "Scan for new features"
msgstr "Zoeken naar nieuwe features"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:215
msgid "Available features:"
msgstr "Beschikbare features:"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:340
msgid "All modules and features where reset to their default settings."
msgstr "Alle modules en features zijn teruggezet naar hun standaardinstellingen."

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:373
msgid "Critical Error: Failed to find modules and features in scan. Is this correct?"
msgstr "Kritieke fout: de scan vond geen modules en features. Klopt dat?"

#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/FeatureActivationSettings.php:377
msgid "Scan was succesful. All Modules and Features succesfully registered."
msgstr "Scan geslaagd. Alle modules en features zijn geregistreerd."

